---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
    seo={{
        title: "Geometry of the Alhambra — Inmaculada Osuna",
        description: "Mathematical modeling of the 17 crystallographic groups and scientific outreach.",
    }}
>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-10 py-12 max-w-4xl mx-auto antialiased">
        <div>
            <a href="/en/projects" class="text-sm font-semibold text-rose-500 hover:text-rose-600 transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18"></path></svg>
                Back to Projects
            </a>
        </div>

        <header class="flex flex-col border-b border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 pb-8">
            <div class="mb-5">
                <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-rose-600 bg-rose-50 border border-rose-200 rounded-full dark:bg-rose-900/20 dark:text-rose-400 dark:border-rose-800/50">MATHEMATICS & OUTREACH</span>
            </div>
            
            <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 dark:text-white mb-3">
                Geometry of the Alhambra
            </h1>
            
            <span class="text-base font-medium text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400 mb-6 flex items-center gap-2">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 14l9-5-9-5-9 5 9 5z"></path><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 14l9-5-9-5-9 5 9 5zm0 0v7"></path></svg>
                Bachelor's Thesis (TFG) — University of Granada .
            </span>
            
            <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
                Mathematical analysis and modeling of the 17 planar crystallographic groups present in the monument's mosaics, brought to digital outreach.
            </p>
        </header>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-12 items-start mt-4">
            <!-- COLUMNA DE TEXTO MEJORADA (EN INGLES) -->
            <div class="lg:col-span-3 flex flex-col gap-8 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
                <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white text-xl flex items-center gap-2">
                        <span class="text-rose-500">◆</span> The Mathematical Challenge & History
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        The decoration of the Alhambra stands as an unparalleled milestone in the history of geometry. Although the mathematical proof that exactly 17 plane crystallographic groups exist was formalized in the late 19th century by Fedorov and Schönflies, Andalusian artisans successfully captured all of them in their mosaics and tilings centuries earlier.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        This research project focused on identifying, proving, and mathematically structuring how these intricate repetitive patterns fit perfectly into the theory of plane symmetry, employing Conway's notation to classify each mosaic visually and intuitively.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white text-xl flex items-center gap-2">
                        <span class="text-rose-500">◆</span> Scientific Outreach & Intellectual Property
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        To take the rigor of Geometry beyond the academic thesis (which was typeset entirely in LaTeX), the research evolved into a visual and interactive format. A total of <strong>nineteen educational videos</strong> were designed, edited, and formally registered with the Intellectual Property Registry.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Using tools like GeoGebra and adapting the editing for social media platforms (TikTok and Instagram), the "mathematical skeleton"—rotation centers, reflection axes, and glide reflections—was seamlessly overlaid onto real footage of the monument, revealing the hidden mathematics behind the stone.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white text-xl flex items-center gap-2">
                        <span class="text-rose-500">◆</span> Cultural & Educational Impact
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        The ultimate goal of this Bachelor's Thesis (TFG) was to transform abstract concepts of algebra and geometry into accessible and engaging content for the general public, proving that science and art speak the same language. This approach not only enriches the tourist experience by providing a new mathematical reading of the monument but also actively promotes the preservation of Andalusian heritage.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-4">
                    <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-700 bg-neutral-100 border border-neutral-200 rounded-lg dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700 shadow-sm">Euclidean Geometry</span>
                    <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-700 bg-neutral-100 border border-neutral-200 rounded-lg dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700 shadow-sm">Crystallographic Groups</span>
                    <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-700 bg-neutral-100 border border-neutral-200 rounded-lg dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700 shadow-sm">GeoGebra / LaTeX</span>
                    <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-700 bg-neutral-100 border border-neutral-200 rounded-lg dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700 shadow-sm">Scientific Outreach</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="lg:col-span-2 flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-6 rounded-3xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 bg-neutral-50 dark:bg-neutral-900/50 shadow-inner">
                <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-400 mb-6 text-center">Presentation Video</p>
                
                <div class="relative w-[280px] h-[500px] rounded-[2.5rem] border-[6px] border-neutral-900 dark:border-neutral-800 bg-black overflow-hidden shadow-2xl flex flex-col group mb-6 mx-auto">
                    <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-24 h-5 bg-neutral-900 dark:bg-neutral-800 rounded-b-xl z-20"></div>
                    <div class="w-full h-full bg-black flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">
                        <div class="w-[325px] origin-center scale-[0.85]">
                            <blockquote class="tiktok-embed" cite="https://www.tiktok.com/@inmaosm/video/7672114144090328342" data-video-id="7672114144090328342" style="max-width: 325px; min-width: 325px; margin: 0;">
                                <section>
                                    <a target="_blank" title="@inmaosm" href="https://www.tiktok.com/@inmaosm?refer=embed">@inmaosm</a>
                                </section>
                            </blockquote>
                            <script async src="https://www.tiktok.com/embed.js" is:inline></script>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@inmaosm" target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white bg-black dark:bg-white dark:text-black rounded-full hover:scale-105 transition-transform shadow-md hover:shadow-lg w-full justify-center max-w-[280px] mx-auto">
                    <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                        <path d="M19.59 6.69a4.83 4.83 0 0 1-3.77-4.25V2h-3.45v13.67a2.89 2.89 0 0 1-5.2 1.74 2.89 2.89 0 0 1 2.31-4.64 2.93 2.93 0 0 1 .88.13V9.4a6.84 6.84 0 0 0-1-.05A6.33 6.33 0 0 0 5 20.1a6.34 6.34 0 0 0 10.86-4.43v-7a8.16 8.16 0 0 0 4.77 1.52v-3.4a4.85 4.85 0 0 1-1-.1z"/>
                    </svg>
                    Visit @inmaosm profile
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- GALERÍA INTERACTIVA -->
        <section class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-8 border-t border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 pt-12">
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
                <h3 class="font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white text-2xl">Mosaics Explorer</h3>
                <p class="text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">Hover over the Alhambra patterns to reveal the mathematical classification of their crystallographic group.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                <!-- Tarjeta Interactiva 1 -->
                <div class="relative group aspect-square rounded-3xl overflow-hidden bg-neutral-200 dark:bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 shadow-sm cursor-pointer">
                    <img src="/mosaico-4-2.png" alt="Mosaico 4*2 Alhambra" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" onerror="this.src='https://placehold.co/400x400/171717/333333?text=Add+Photo+4*2'" />
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-neutral-900/85 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-6 text-center backdrop-blur-md">
                        <span class="font-extrabold text-4xl tracking-widest mb-2 font-mono">
                            <span class="text-blue-400">4</span><span class="text-rose-500">*2</span>
                        </span>
                        <p class="text-white text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed">Minimum 90° rotation with symmetry presence, but no symmetry across 4 axes.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Tarjeta Interactiva 2 -->
                <div class="relative group aspect-square rounded-3xl overflow-hidden bg-neutral-200 dark:bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 shadow-sm cursor-pointer">
                    <img src="/mosaico-o.jpg" alt="Mosaico o (Pajarita Nazarí) Alhambra" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" onerror="this.src='https://placehold.co/400x400/171717/333333?text=Add+Photo+o'" />
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-neutral-900/85 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-6 text-center backdrop-blur-md">
                        <span class="text-blue-400 font-extrabold text-4xl tracking-widest mb-2 font-mono">o</span>
                        <p class="text-white text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed">No rotations, axial symmetries, or glide reflections. Known for the famous <strong>Nasrid bow-tie</strong> pattern.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Tarjeta Interactiva 3 -->
                <div class="relative group aspect-square rounded-3xl overflow-hidden bg-neutral-200 dark:bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 shadow-sm cursor-pointer">
                    <img src="/632.png" alt="Mosaico 632 Alhambra" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" onerror="this.src='https://placehold.co/400x400/171717/333333?text=Add+Photo+632'" />
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-neutral-900/85 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-6 text-center backdrop-blur-md">
                        <span class="text-blue-400 font-extrabold text-4xl tracking-widest mb-2 font-mono">632</span>
                        <p class="text-white text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed">Minimum 60° rotation without any axial or glide-reflection symmetry.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>
</Layout>